aped to include the batch dimension, and `train_y` is used directly as the target tensor. The `DataLoader` is used to create batches of data, which helps manage memory usage and provides additional functionality like shuffling.\\n\\n3) Where to read more:\\n- [drive/MyDrive/dataset/nn/torch.nn.CrossEntropyLoss.md][§2]\\n- [drive/MyDrive/dataset/torch/compiler/torch.compiler_troubleshooting.md][§1]"\n}\nOutput: ', 'role': 'user'}], 'model': 'Qwen/Qwen2.5-32B-Instruct-AWQ', 'n': 1, 'stream': False, 'temperature': 0.01}}
