se where target is  0.5 involves creating a mask.",\n        "Mask is created with (target == 0.5).float().",\n        "Zero loss is applied to the mask with mask * 0.",\n        "Total loss combines bce_loss and zero_loss.",\n        "Mean loss is calculated as total_loss.mean().",\n        "This approach ensures that the standard BCE loss is computed for all samples except those with target=0.5.",\n        "For samples with target=0.5, the loss is explicitly set to zero.",\n        "Additional reading can be found at §1 drive/MyDrive/dataset/amp/torch.nn.functional.binary_cross_entropy_with_logits.md."\n    ]\n}\nOutput: ', 'role': 'user'}], 'model': 'Qwen/Qwen2.5-32B-Instruct-AWQ', 'n': 1, 'stream': False, 'temperature': 0.01}}
